After three years of off-and-on playing, I have finally Ascended.  I
posted a YAFAP on my website, and rather than copying all of the text
here, here's the link to my post:

http://www.hardgeus.com/index.php?ndailyupdateid=700

I'm running noegnud-nethack, and as far as I know it doesn't keep
an ascension log, so I took screenshots of everything and uploaded them to
a Yahoo album.

The bottom line important things I learned during my ascension:

1) Don't fight unarmed.  Get a good artifact.

2) If you get a wish, wish for something that will get you magic
resistance.  Magic resistance is the #1 most important thing you can get.

3) Master Kaen isn't that bad if you levitate over the lava and shoot him
with spells.  If you don't have levitation, use a scroll of earth to build
a wall.

4) Wear an amulet of lifesaving instead of reflection.  Even though I
never needed it in *this* ascension, goofy insta-deaths are what screwed
me in my last games where I hit the castle.

5) Play neutral.  Chaotic artifacts suck.

6) Use a small shield keep it equipped and +5 at all times.




